### Example Example 198

**Markdown input:**

```markdown
| foo | bar |
| --- | --- |
| baz | bim |
```

**Expected HTML output:**

```html
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>foo</th>
<th>bar</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>baz</td>
<td>bim</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
```

### Example Example 199

**Markdown input:**

```markdown
| abc | defghi |
:-: | -----------:
bar | baz
```

**Expected HTML output:**

```html
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="center">abc</th>
<th align="right">defghi</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="center">bar</td>
<td align="right">baz</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
```

### Example Example 200

**Markdown input:**

```markdown
| f\|oo  |
| ------ |
| b `\|` az |
| b **\|** im |
```

**Expected HTML output:**

```html
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>f|oo</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>b <code>|</code> az</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>b <strong>|</strong> im</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
```

